    title: "Disclaimer",
    seoTitle: "Face Shape and Styling Disclaimer",
    description: "Understand the limits of face-shape estimates, photo analysis, styling and eyewear information, external links, and personal choice.",
    eyebrow: "Important limitations",
    intro: "VisageMetric provides an informal visual estimate and general style information. It does not provide biometric identification, scientific classification, medical advice, eye-care advice, or a guarantee that one category or recommendation will suit every person.",
